    "reason": "Recheck the queue after arming native wakeup. A worker can enqueue between the first empty check and wakeup arming; the old native wait then strands an already queued event. Controlled native old/candidate proof and actual independent Terminal query workloads support this correction. SDL version and Zlib license remain unchanged."
